/*!
  \page example_cxx_fit_plane_page Plane fitting

  This example fits a plane with Ponca::CovariancePlaneFit to random data, and computes the surface variation
  \cite Pauly:2002:PSSimplification, a measure of the deviation of the neighborhood from a plane (see
  \ref fittingreference_outputandcapabilities).

  Build and run:
  \code{.sh}
  cmake --build build --target ponca_fit_plane
  ./build/examples/cpp/ponca_fit_plane
  \endcode

  \include cpp/ponca_fit_plane.cpp
*/
